    k\u1EF7 nguy\xEAn, ch\xEDnh Nh\xE2n t\u1ED9c \u0111\xE3 sinh ra nhi\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EA1i
    n\u0103ng gi\u1EA3 nh\u1EA5t, ph\xE1 v\u1EE1 thi\xEAn m\u1EC7nh v\xE0 khai s\xE1ng
    k\u1EF7 nguy\xEAn m\u1EDBi."
